    "name": "Finnigan Fox",
    "steam_appid": 3588330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnigan Fox is a 2D action platformer with fun RPG elements. Inspired by the glorious days of 16-bit platformers, Finnigan Fox presents classic gameplay in beautiful, colorful, hi-res graphics with a difficulty level adapted to modern sensibilities--meaning it\u2019s not so brutally hard! \ud83e\udd23</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FOX LIKE NO OTHER\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as our titular hero, a clever red fox named Finnigan. Run and leap your way across the land on your mission to save the forest. Wield your bladed crossbow to defeat enemies in your path! Cast magic that changes the season to alter the terrain and neutralize some enemies. You\u2019ll need a combination of melee <i>and </i>magic to solve the puzzles in a mystical land filled with strange creatures and challenging landscapes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES &amp; BOSSES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure and special items along the way (sometimes hidden). Trade them in at the forest shops to upgrade your arrows and increase your physical and magical capacity.\u00a0 You\u2019ll need those upgrades to prepare yourself to take on screen-sized bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss is a giant enemy with a different behavior and unique vulnerability. Use your nimble movement to avoid their attacks until you can solve the puzzle of how to defeat them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 SEASONS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between seasons to alter the terrain, explore new areas, outfox enemies and uncover amazing secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HERO\u2019S JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Finnigan Fox uncover the mystery of the 5th season and bring back justice to the forests and its inhabitants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION PLATFORMER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnigan Fox is an epic adventure with engaging RPG elements, clever puzzles and thrilling platforming.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnigan Fox is a 2D action platformer with fun RPG elements. Inspired by the glorious days of 16-bit platformers, Finnigan Fox presents classic gameplay in beautiful, colorful, hi-res graphics with a difficulty level adapted to modern sensibilities--meaning it\u2019s not so brutally hard! \ud83e\udd23</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A FOX LIKE NO OTHER\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as our titular hero, a clever red fox named Finnigan. Run and leap your way across the land on your mission to save the forest. Wield your bladed crossbow to defeat enemies in your path! Cast magic that changes the season to alter the terrain and neutralize some enemies. You\u2019ll need a combination of melee <i>and </i>magic to solve the puzzles in a mystical land filled with strange creatures and challenging landscapes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES &amp; BOSSES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect treasure and special items along the way (sometimes hidden). Trade them in at the forest shops to upgrade your arrows and increase your physical and magical capacity.\u00a0 You\u2019ll need those upgrades to prepare yourself to take on screen-sized bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss is a giant enemy with a different behavior and unique vulnerability. Use your nimble movement to avoid their attacks until you can solve the puzzle of how to defeat them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 SEASONS!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between seasons to alter the terrain, explore new areas, outfox enemies and uncover amazing secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HERO\u2019S JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Finnigan Fox uncover the mystery of the 5th season and bring back justice to the forests and its inhabitants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACTION PLATFORMER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnigan Fox is an epic adventure with engaging RPG elements, clever puzzles and thrilling platforming.</p>",
    "short_description": "Join Finnigan Fox on a journey into a magical land. Take up your sword and crossbow to defeat enemies! Master the seasons with your magic to solve puzzles. Collect treasure to upgrade your equipment and abilities. Find all the special tree seeds to help your friends rescue the forest!",
